      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Kuwahara averages whichever corner around a pixel is the smoothest, so flat areas melt into strokes of color while the edges stay sharp, and a camera picture looks painted. Choose a camera or a clip in the Main Input panel to feed it. Set Size larger for broader strokes, at more cost."
        }
      },
